  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: 500 Rummy. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '500 Rummy: first to 500 points wins. Melds (sets and runs) score positive; unmelded cards in hand count negative. Key twist: you may draw any card from the discard pile but must take all cards above it and meld the drawn card immediately. 2-8 players; 52 cards plus 2 jokers.',
    objective: "Score through melds while managing the discard pack and meeting the game's point target.",
    gameplay: 'Deal fifteen cards to each player, turn one card to start the pack, and let players draw from stock or pick up the pack when they can immediately meld the required pair with the top discard. Melds are three or more cards of the same rank, and the discard pack can grow into a major tactical resource.',
    keyRules: [
      'Only same-rank melds of three or more cards are legal.',
      'A player who picks up the pack must immediately meld using the top discard.',
      'The game uses two full standard decks.',
    ],
